      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "I see the error, in latest transformers library upgrade, they have fixed initializing DataCollatorForLanguageModeling by moving the runtime error to an initialization check.\n\nWe normally catch it here.\nhttps://github.com/kaito-project/kaito/blob/main/presets/workspace/tuning/text-generation/fine_tuning.py#L57-L62\n\nNow its in their `__post_init__`\nhttps://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/main/src/transformers/data/data_collator.py#L832C7-L836C14\n\nThis is causing the error. Working on fix.\n\n\n",
